        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>
<p class="title" style="font-size: 300%;">Success!</p>
<p class="para" style="font-size: 200%;">Your report has been successfully submitted. Feel free to contact me on other <u><a data-astro-prefetch="load" href="https://admin.thehumanserver.org">services</a></u> as well.</p>
